// app.rc — Windows resource script
//
// This file is compiled by the MSVC resource compiler (rc.exe) and linked
// into the .exe. It tells Windows which .ico file to use as the executable's
// icon — the one shown in File Explorer, the taskbar, and Alt+Tab.
//
// IDI_ICON1 is the conventional ID for the main application icon.
// Windows picks the icon with the lowest numeric ID as the "default" icon,
// so using 1 (IDI_ICON1) ensures this icon is always chosen.

IDI_ICON1 ICON "assets/app.ico"
